      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:beit_qodshenu_vetifartenu">
        <tei:pb n="94" ed="1912" facs="https://archive.org/download/selichothdavidasher1912/page/n190_medium.jpg"/>
        <tei:p>Our holy and beautiful house, where our fathers praised thee, is burnt up with fire: and all our pleasant things are laid waste. They have cast fire into thy sanctuary; they have defiled the dwelling place of thy name. Help, Lord; for the godly man ceaseth; for the faithful fail from among the children of men. </tei:p>
